cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "GAMP 5 Synthetic URS + FS + DS Corpus"
message: >-
  If you use this corpus, please cite it as below. The corpus is synthetic,
  AI-authored, and not a regulated record. See README.md and KNOWN_LIMITATIONS.md.
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Attia
    given-names: Nabil
    affiliation: Neural Architects / na IT Consulting GmbH
    email: nat@naitc.de
    orcid: ""
repository-code: "https://github.com/neuralarchitects-de/gamp5-corpus"
url: "https://neuralarchitects.ae/gxp-corpus"
abstract: >-
  Fifty synthetic User Requirements Specifications (URS) for GxP-regulated
  computer systems, paired one-to-one with fifty matching Functional
  Specifications (FS) and fifty matching Design Specifications (DS). Generated
  from public regulatory primary sources (FDA guidance, ISPE GAMP 5, ICH text,
  EU GMP Annex 11, EU AI Act 2024/1689). The corpus covers GAMP Categories 1,
  3, 4, and 5 across laboratory instruments, production control systems,
  enterprise quality applications, infrastructure, and custom-developed AI/ML
  platforms. Three paired specification tiers (URS → FS → DS) close the
  GAMP 5 V-model authoring chain end-to-end. Intended as a seed corpus for
  fine-tuning, RAG grounding, and reference templating in regulated
  industries. Not a regulated record; not derived from any client data; not
  vetted by any regulator.
keywords:
